        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, join a full-day group tour to the fishing village of Vila da Trindade, about 30 minutes from Paraty. The programme lasts around six hours. Travel by minibus with an accredited guide who will explain the history, ecology and culture of this stretch of coast.\n\n\n\n\nThe route takes in Praia do Cepilho, a popular surf beach, Praia dos Ranchos, where you’ll stop for lunch at your own expense on the way back, and Praia do Meio, which is suitable for swimming. At Praia dos Ranchos, there are fishermen’s bars, and the rocks along the shore form natural sculptures.\n\n\n\n\nFrom there, follow the trail to Cachadaço Beach. The walk takes about 40 minutes and is moderately challenging. The final stop is the rock-ringed natural pool at Caixa d’Aço, where you can swim or snorkel and watch for fish and other marine life."
    },
